From c7b4935df3fc142a4883f956a2ccc7c53e7560d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Kwabena W. Agyeman" <kwagyeman@live.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 15:20:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] ports/mimxrt: Call machine_init() and
 machine_set_soft_reset().

MicroPython's mimxrt port now works out machine.reset_cause() once at
boot in machine_init(), and records a soft reset in
machine_set_soft_reset() (micropython#19619). Its main.c calls both;
OpenMV's main.c replaces that one, so call them here too. Without
them reset_cause() returns 0.
---
 ports/mimxrt/main.c | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ports/mimxrt/main.c b/ports/mimxrt/main.c
index 464a160b8..4c8c14485 100644
--- a/ports/mimxrt/main.c
+++ b/ports/mimxrt/main.c
@@ -87,6 +87,7 @@ int main(void) {
     ticks_init();
     led_init();
     pendsv_init();
+    machine_init();
 
 soft_reset:
     led_init();
@@ -233,6 +234,7 @@ soft_reset:
     machine_encoder_deinit_all();
     #endif
     imlib_deinit();
+    machine_set_soft_reset();
     gc_sweep_all();
     mp_deinit();
     first_soft_reset = false;
